3.5 Explainable AI (SHAP)

To improve interpretability and reduce black-box behaviour, PRAISE incorporates Explainable AI methods using SHAP values.

Two forms of explanation are currently supported.

SHAP Summary Plot

SHAP summary plots provide:

* Feature ranking
* Directionality
* Contribution magnitude
* Feature value distribution

These visualisations provide insight into both the importance of variables and their influence on model predictions.

⸻

SHAP Waterfall Plot

SHAP waterfall plots provide observation-level explanations.

Individual feature contributions are displayed sequentially, illustrating how predictions evolve from baseline values to final outputs.

Together these analyses improve transparency and support governance review.

