3.7 Human Validation Layer

To complement machine evaluation, PRAISE introduces additional validation layers to support expert review.

Decile Analysis

Decile analysis is applied to assess ranking capability and separation performance.

⸻

Distribution Analysis

Distribution analysis evaluates separation between:

* Good populations
* Bad populations

These additional analyses ensure that final feature selection is supported by both machine evaluation and human judgement.

