4.2 Governance Constraints

Governance and business constraints may be introduced before rule generation.

Supported configurations include:

* Minimum bad capture requirements
* Maximum production loss thresholds
* Population constraints

These controls ensure generated rules remain practically implementable and aligned with business objectives.

