4.3 Rule Evaluation Metrics

Different use cases require different optimisation objectives.

PRAISE therefore supports flexible metric selection.

Risk-focused metrics include:

* Bad rate
* Marginal bad rate
* Bad capture

Business metrics include:

* Production retention
* Volume impact

Efficiency metrics include:

* Good-to-bad ratio

Single or multiple optimisation objectives may be applied.

⸻

4.4 Rule Construction

The framework currently supports:

One-dimensional rules

Single feature structures.

⸻

Two-dimensional rules

Two-feature combinations.

⸻

Three-dimensional rules

Multi-feature interactions.

Logical operators supported include:

AND

OR

Both structures are generated and evaluated.

Although top-ranked outputs may occasionally contain predominantly OR structures, AND combinations are also generated and available within downstream outputs.

