4.5 Rule Search and Optimisation

Grid search methodology is applied to systematically explore feasible rule combinations.

The framework evaluates candidate structures within the defined search space while respecting governance constraints.

Generated outputs include:

* Rule logic
* Performance summaries
* Ranking metrics
* Candidate comparisons

Rules may subsequently be prioritised according to selected objectives.

